 ice)\nAward: USD 1\,500 per fellow\, at least five fellowships\, plus trav
 el reimbursement to present at the i3 Technical Working Group meeting in D
 ecember 2027. No application fee.\nDuration: 12 months (January to Decembe
 r 2027)\n\nMore: https://www.nber.org/calls-papers-and-proposals/open-data
 -fellows-program-2027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=ref
 erral
