SUMMARY:Deadline: Coding it Forward: Winter Fellowship 2027 (US civic tech 
 placements)
DESCRIPTION:Coding it Forward's Winter Fellowship is a paid\, full-time\, t
 en-week job placement that embeds early-career technologists in city\, sta
 te and federal government offices across the United States.\n\nOrganisatio
 n: Coding it Forward\nLocation: United States. Winter 2027 placements are 
 with the State of North Carolina and the State of New Jersey\; some roles 
 are fully remote (within the US)\, some involve an in-person component. Ap
 plicants must be US citizens\, US nationals or permanent residents and mus
 t physically reside in the US for the duration.\nAward: Paid full-time job
  placement: USD 20 per hour for applicants with a Bachelor's degree\, USD 
 25 per hour for applicants pursuing or holding a graduate degree (Master's
  or PhD)\, at 40 hours per week for ten weeks (roughly USD 8\,000 to 10\,0
 00 in total). Pay rates and work dates are non-negotiable. No application 
 fee.\nDuration: Ten weeks full-time (40 hours per week)\, 11 January to 19
  March 2027.\n\nMore: https://codingitforward.com/fellowship?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://codingitforward.com/fellowship?utm_source=artificialnouveaugran
 tdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:United States. Winter 2027 placements are with the State of North 
 Carolina and the State of New Jersey\; some roles are fully remote (within
  the US)\, some involve an in-person component. Applicants must be US citi
 zens\, US nationals or permanent residents and must physically reside in t
 he US for the duration.
END:VEVENT
