SUMMARY:Deadline: Mozilla Foundation Fellowship 2027-28 (up to USD 125\,000
 \, letter of intent 17 Dec)
DESCRIPTION:Mozilla Foundation's 2027-28 Fellowship backs 10 people working
  on technology that is "too early\, too unexpected\, or too ambitious for 
 anyone else to fund"\, reimagining emerging technology while its future is
  still being decided. Each Fellow receives up to USD 125\,000 over 12 mont
 hs (USD 100\,000 stipend plus USD 25\,000 project budget) to lead an indep
 endent project.\n\nOrganisation: Mozilla Foundation\nLocation: Internation
 al. Fellows lead independent projects\; the cohort meets at in-person gath
 erings.\nAward: Up to USD 125\,000 over 12 months: a USD 100\,000 stipend 
 plus a USD 25\,000 project budget. 10 Fellowships awarded. No application 
 fee stated.\nDuration: 12 months\, from 1 June 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.
 mozillafoundation.org/en/what-we-do/grantmaking/fellowship/2027-call-for-a
 pplications/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.mozillafoundation.org/en/what-we-do/grantmaking/fellowship/
 2027-call-for-applications/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medi
 um=referral
LOCATION:International. Fellows lead independent projects\; the cohort meet
 s at in-person gatherings.
END:VEVENT
